      <w:r>
       <w:t>00 = Data Capture mode. In this mode, the PSA Signature Register does not compress data when it is written. Any data written to PSA Signature Register is simply captured by PSA Signature Register without any compression. This mode can be used to plant seed value into the PSA register. </w:t>
