      <w:r>
       <w:t>Channel 4 Timeout Interrupt Disable Bit Writing a one to this bit disable the timeout interrupt. Writing a zero has no effect. Reading from this bit gives the status (interrupt enable/disable). User and privileged mode read: 0 = Timeout Interrupt disable 1 = Timeout Interrupt enable User and privileged mode write: 0 = Has no effect 1 = Timeout Interrupt enable</w:t>
