     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Tx Ring Size Register contains the element size and element counts for the ring which is used to hand off pending work for the channel from the Host. A write to this register will reset the associated ring to clear the occupancies and reset the pointers.</w:t>
