       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>Current HW owned read index for the ring.  This value is initialized to 0 when the ring is set up and will be incremented by HW each time HW processes a ring entry.  When the index is incremented to a value equal to the size field in the Ring Size Register for the ring the index will be reset back to 0.</w:t>
      </w:r>
