    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Tx Ring Base Address Hi Register contains the 16 MSBs of the base address for the ring which is used to hand off pending work for the channel from the Host. The base address must be aligned to the element size of the ring, or to double the element size of the ring if the qmode is CREDENTIALS or QM modes. A write to this register will reset the associated ring to clear the occupancies and reset the pointers.</w:t>
