       <w:t>Current message count for the proxy thread. For an inbound proxy this is the number of available messages. For an outbound proxy this is the number of free messages that can be written. This value will initialize itself to 0 if the THREAD[a]_CTL register is written with dir set to inbound, or to the max_cnt value if the THREAD[a]_CTL register is written with dir set to outbound, as these are the starting values for a newly configured thread.</w:t>
