       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>Indicates to replace the bus orderid value for this ring or queue with the orderid MMR field. This allows control over the orderid value when it must be restricted due to the topology for QoS reasons. 0 = bypass and use the orderid from the source transaction for the destination transaction. 1 = use the orderid MMR field value for the destination transaction.</w:t>
      </w:r>
