        <w:keepNext/>
       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>This field controls how pointers will be interpreted for non Ring Accelerator accesses on this channel.  All transactions from this channel which are not destined to the Ring Accelerator will have the mem*_catype attribute set equal to the value given in this register field.  Accesses to the RA or descriptors will use the virtual credentials register.</w:t>
      </w:r>
