       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>Selects the index to use for the trigger. For a channel trigger type it will be the TR event for the channel number specified. For an external signal or timer signal it will select the bit of the global interfaces that come into the DMA as specified in the SOC specification</w:t>
      </w:r>
      </w:p>
