     <w:spacing w:before="120"/>
     <w:ind w:first-line="0"/>
     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Interrupt Status Masked register is the bitwise AND of the INT_ENABLE register and the INT_STATUS REGISTER. It can be read by software to determine the cause of the level sensitive interrupt that is generated by this ring. </w:t>
    </w:r>
   </w:p>
