     <w:spacing w:before="120"/>
     <w:ind w:first-line="0"/>
     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Flow Realtime Registers region is accessed by setting the cfg_rsel signal to 4 during the access.  This region is sparsely populated based on the flows used. The a value used in addressing is the flow number and should be determined by the channel map for the DMA along with the number of flows supported by the channel. The channel number associated with the flow is always the smallest flow number supported. The address map for this region is as follows:</w:t>
    </w:r>
   </w:p>
     <wx:sub-section>
