     <w:spacing w:before="120"/>
     <w:ind w:first-line="0"/>
     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The BCDMA Channel Configuration Registers region is accessed by setting the cdma_cfg_rsel signal to 1 during the access.  This region is sparsely populated based on the channel used. The value used in addressing is the channel number and should be determined by the channel map for the DMA. The address map for this region is as follows:</w:t>
    </w:r>
   </w:p>
