     <w:spacing w:before="120"/>
     <w:ind w:first-line="0"/>
     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Resource Register determines if certain resources remain only in the configuration register or can be aliased in the real-time region to allow for a user process to manage the channel itself.</w:t>
    </w:r>
   </w:p>
