      <w:p>
       <w:pPr>
        <w:ind w:left="30" w:right="0"/>
       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>This field specifies how many full FIFO operations comprise a complete packet. When the count has been reached, the Peripheral will close the packet with an End of Packet indication that will cause the DMA to end the current packet or TR. If this parameter is set to NULL, then no packet delineation is supplied by the Peripheral and all framing is controlled via the paired DMA TR.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      </w:p>
     </w:tc>
    </w:tr>
