     <w:spacing w:before="120"/>
     <w:ind w:first-line="0"/>
     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The debug event control to select when the debug controller can issue an event that can be used by another debug event control. Writing to this register will reset the counter.</w:t>
    </w:r>
