     <w:jc w:val="both"/>
    </w:pPr>
    <w:r>
     <w:t>The Channel Realtime Registers region is accessed by setting the cdma_cfg_rsel signal to 2 during the access.  This region is sparsely populated based on the channel used. The register definition is per channel and the channel number desired should be determined by the channel map for the DMA. The address map for this region is as follows:</w:t>
    </w:r>
   </w:p>
