      <w:p>
       <w:pPr>
        <w:ind w:left="30" w:right="0"/>
       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>This field holds the current Y count. In X-Y FIFO mode, this is the number of X sized samples yet to be read from the peripheral for the DMA event being serviced. In MCAN mode, this field holds the next read offset to use when read to the CAN RX buffer.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      </w:p>
     </w:tc>
