      <w:r>
       <w:t>This bit is set whenever the Flow ID firewall detects a Flow ID is out of range for an incoming packet.  Once this bit is set, the remaining fields in this register will not be modified.  SW is required to write this bit to 0 to allow another exception to be captured.</w:t>
      </w:r>
