       </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
       <w:t>This bit when set indicates that a teardown is complete on the channel.  This bit is cleared anytime the tdown_ack bit is written as a 1 in the corresponding Ring N Doorbell Register.  This bit is only valid on the reverse rings (rings consumed by the Host SW).</w:t>
      </w:r>
      </w:p>
     </w:tc>
